   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "…then 3-1 to 3-7, 4-1 to 4-7\nand 5-1 to 5-7, up to the end\nround's planning phase",
   "originalText": "…then 3-1 to 3-7, 4-1 to 4-7\nand 5-1 to 5-7, up to the end\nround's planning phase",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "text-35",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 396,
   "width": 778.96,
   "height": 17.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1288340189,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1521984706,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every round has a planning phase (income arrives, gold can be spent) and then, in PvP rounds only, a fight.",
   "originalText": "Every round has a planning phase (income arrives, gold can be spent) and then, in PvP rounds only, a fight.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
