   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Or a custom Scenario: a string of w and l, one letter per PvP fight (11 letters reach 4-2), with its own gold and level targets.\nStreak gold follows the real run of results, across stages. Carousels and neutrals pay a reward but never break a streak.",
